      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Currency Converter\n\nA simple offline browser app that converts amounts between USD, EUR, JPY, and CNY using fixed built-in exchange rates. It features a pixel-art inspired design with a cohesive color palette and fully accessible, keyboard-friendly controls.\n\n## Features\n\n- Convert between USD, EUR, JPY, and CNY with fixed rates.\n- Input an amount, select from and to currencies, and see the converted result to two decimal places.\n- Swap button to quickly exchange the from and to currencies.\n- Keyboard accessible with labeled controls and focus states.\n- Responsive layout that works from 360px wide.\n- Pixel-art style with blocky borders, shadows, and a dark themed background.\n\n## Usage\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern web browser. No server or internet connection required.\n\n1. Enter an amount in the input field.\n2. Select the source currency from the \"From\" dropdown.\n3. Select the target currency from the \"To\" dropdown.\n4. The converted amount updates automatically.\n5. Click the swap button (⇄) to exchange the from and to currencies.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – Main HTML structure.\n- `styles.css` – Styling and pixel-art theme.\n- `script.js` – Conversion logic and event handling.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Exchange rates are fixed and hardcoded for offline use.\n- No external dependencies, network requests, or server code.\n- All controls are keyboard accessible with visible focus states.\n- The app uses system fonts at 16px or larger for readability.\n\n## License\n\nThis project is open source and available under the MIT License.",
